WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:12.350
Shinji! Shinji! Shinji! Shinji!

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.400
And after the first match had 
everyone feeling so united...

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.270
Shinji! Shinji! Shinji! Shinji!

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:26.990
Okay, everyone... Let me introduce 
the next tournament card.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:29.370
Here's our first participant.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.210
Chojiro Tokumatsu!

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:38.010
Riding on this, to duel...

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.820
Duels really have changed since my time.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.500
Some of you may remember him.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:48.130
This is Enjoy Chojiro, back after ten years away!

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.580
Mr. Tokumatsu...

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.680
Good to see you again, everyone.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.350
Enjoy Chojiro is back!

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.810
This, too, Yuya...

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.940
It's thanks to you, who reminded 
me how to enjoy a duel.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:12.180
And to those who did everything they 
could to get me out of there.

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:15.790
I swear I'll win and stay in the fight.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:19.940
His opponent will be our tournament's 
first female duelist,

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:22.260
Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:23.270
Yuzu!

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.860
She's fighting before I am?

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:29.250
Yuzu...

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.140
It isn't me again?

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:35.420
Good luck, Yuzu! Everyone's watching you!

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.140
Yuya...

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.030
No way.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.520
Yuzu's gonna fight Mr. Tokumatsu?

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.600
D-Wheels.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.780
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:52.440
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:55.880
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.140
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:36.700
The Racing Diva

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.670
Please let me out of here!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:48.330
As a fellow woman, I'm rooting for Yuzu!

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:52.740
Whoever wins, a precious 
friend of mine will be sent

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.380
to the underground labor facility.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:01.040
No matter what simulation I run,

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.540
I can't find any chance that I might lose.

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:07.910
To send this pretty, young girl to the underground...

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.760
Forgive me, my dear!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.100
H-Huh?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.090
What's he apologizing for?

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.300
Now, Action Field, on!

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:22.970
Field Spell Crossover Acceleration!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:27.080
Duel mode, on. Autopilot, stand by.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:34.010
Riding duel... Acceleration!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.490
Duel!

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:40.730
Is she gonna be okay?

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:43.110
I-I'm scared.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:47.370
Hugo said D-Wheels don't tip over easily, but...

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.450
The first to take the corner, 
and thus the first turn,

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.940
is Tokumatsu, Enjoy Chojiro!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.800
Forgive me, my dear.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.080
My turn!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.910
I summon Flower Cardian Pine from my hand!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:06.320
I activate Flower Cardian Pine with 
Crane's effect from my hand!

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:09.290
I tribute Pine, to Special Summon it!

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:16.860
And when I successfully Special 
Summon it, I draw a card!

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:19.100
If the card I draw is not a Flower Cardian,

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.070
I send that card to the graveyard.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.170
I now end my turn.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:28.010
Okay, Yuzu gets to take her turn!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.040
I need to let Yuya know that I'm doing fine.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.680
My turn!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.030
When my opponent alone has monsters on the field,

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:39.500
I can Special Summon Solo the Melodious 
Songstress from my hand.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:45.550
And I summon Opera the Melodious 
Diva from my hand!

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:48.530
On the turn this card is summoned, 
it cannot attack.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.480
What's going on here?

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.530
Solo, which she Special Summoned,

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:56.490
has fewer attack points than 
Tokumatsu's Pine with Crane.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:59.640
But Opera, which has more attack 
points, can't attack this turn!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.820
I activate my Continuous Spell Fortissimo!

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:06.280
Once per turn, I can increase the attack points

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:09.110
of one Melodious monster by 600.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:13.320
I increase the attack points of Solo 
the Melodious Songstress.

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:17.460
Battle!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:20.790
I use Solo the Melodious Songstress 
to attack Pine with Crane!

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.870
Yuzu inflicts first damage on Tokumatsu!

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:31.620
Yuzu...

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:34.670
Don't get all the attention before I do!

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:37.040
I end my turn.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.560
Not bad, but... Forgive me!

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:42.650
H-He's apologizing again?

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:43.880
It's freaking me out.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:48.990
My turn! I activate my spell card 
Recardination from my hand!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:53.460
It lets me Special Summon one Flower 
Cardian monster from my graveyard.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.930
Come, Flower Cardian Pine with Crane!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:00.640
I also activate my spell card Sneaky 
Sleeve from my hand.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:03.640
Its effect lets me change the level 
of one Flower Cardian to 2.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.840
And I draw one card from my deck!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:11.980
Once I draw that card, Enjoy Chojiro 
will truly be reborn...

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.010
Enjoy!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.400
Forgive me!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.250
What's with this guy?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.790
I activate my spell card Super Koi Koi!

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.100
This is...

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:27.590
Mr. Tokumatsu's on the way to domination, I see.

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.020
Yuzu...

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.540
This lets me draw three cards from my deck.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:36.190
If they're Flower Cardians, I can 
Special Summon them.

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:40.590
But for each I draw that is not a Flower Cardian,

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.680
I send it to the graveyard and 
take 1000 points of damage.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:45.640
The first!

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:48.230
Come on, come on, come on, 
come on, come on!

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.350
Flower Cardian Zebra Grass with Moon!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.050
The second...

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:55.320
Come on, come on, come on, 
come on, come on!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.620
Flower Cardian Paulownia with Phoenix!

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:01.360
And then, the third!

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:04.000
Come on, come on, come on, 
come on, come on!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.530
Flower Cardian Willow with Calligrapher!

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.230
All three were Flower Cardians?

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:11.700
Wow!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:16.210
Celebrate! Enjoy Chojiro is now reborn!

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:21.930
The attack and defense points of Flower Cardians 
summoned with Super Koi Koi become 0,

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.850
and their levels become 2!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.350
Now, Level 2 Flower Cardian 
Willow with Calligrapher

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:32.560
tunes Level 2 Pine with Crane, Zebra Grass 
with Moon, and Paulownia with Phoenix!

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:38.570
Rain of tears! Turn to light and rain down!

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:42.530
Synchro Summon!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:45.480
Flower Cardian Lightshower!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.280
Battle!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:55.930
Lightshower attacks Solo the 
Melodious Songstress!

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.220
I won't lose. I...

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.520
An Action Card!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.790
Action Spell Take Flight!

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:10.840
The attack points of one monster under attack

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:14.230
are increased by 600 until the 
end of the Battle Phase!

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.140
Yuzu's taken flight, but she 
hasn't gained any ground!

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.670
I'm not done yet.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:25.880
What?

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.780
What magnificent acrobatics!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.480
Great one!

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:34.590
Action Spell Take Flight!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.680
I increase its attack points by 600.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:43.000
Yuzu's monster has more attack points 
than Tokumatsu's monster!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.410
Action!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.700
Action Spell Miracle!

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:55.410
My monster isn't destroyed by battle, 
and battle damage to me is halved!

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.750
You're not bad, dear. This is an exciting duel.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:03.470
I won't lose.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.980
I absolutely won't lose!

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:11.490
You don't seem to be just 
obsessed with winning.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:13.660
But, my dear...

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:18.800
Whenever you draw, Lightshower deals 
1500 damage to you.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.700
Forgive me. I now end my turn.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:26.670
Yuzu will surely take 1500 damage next turn!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:29.640
I won't waver in this duel.

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:31.180
I won't show weakness.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.080
My turn!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.050
She drew without hesitation!

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:38.010
Lightshower's effect activates!

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:47.330
There seems to be some explanation 
behind that tough spirit of yours.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.810
There's someone I need to tell my feelings.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:57.450
Right now, he's probably depressed 
and blaming himself.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:01.100
So I want him to know that he isn't alone.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.540
I'll use everything I have to let him know that.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.180
It isn't over.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:10.180
The fun is only getting started!

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.150
The fun is only getting started?

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.410
The fun is only getting started!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:24.230
My dear, the one you want to communicate 
with... Could it be?

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:33.600
I tribute Solo the Melodious Songstress and Opera 
the Melodious Diva, to Tribute Summon...

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.350
Everyone, your attention please!

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:43.780
Taking the stage with dazzling radiance, 
it's Mozarta the Melodious Maestra!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.650
I activate Mozarta the 
Melodious Maestra's effect!

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:50.910
Once per turn,

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:55.090
I can Special Summon one Melodious monster, 
Level 4 or below, from my hand.

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:56.860
It's your time on stage.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.560
I Special Summon Aria the Melodious Diva!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.990
Now, now. This is almost like...

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.370
Don't do an entertainment duel 
before I get the chance to!

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.610
There's still more to come.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.410
I activate my Continuous Spell Fortissimo

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:19.280
to increase Mozarta's attack points by 600!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:27.100
Mozarta is on stage, wearing her 
most spectacular dress.

00:12:27.880 --> 00:12:29.820
This is less like a duel...

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.460
And more like a fashion show or a concert.

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.200
Looking good!

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:36.570
The audience is cheering for her.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:39.280
Yuzu, keep going!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.040
Battle.

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:43.240
Mozarta attacks Lightshower.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.020
Go! Get fired up!

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:46.610
Let your blood boil!

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:49.880
Get fired up... Let your blood boil.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:52.240
I'm not done yet.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.920
I'm not enjoying this enough!

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.220
Graceful Wave!

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:06.590
Action Spell Evade!

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:10.080
I negate the attack of one monster!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:11.740
Tokumatsu dodged it!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.090
Not bad, my dear...

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:15.840
That entertainment duel of yours.

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:19.810
He knows about entertainment duels?

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.060
But forgive me.

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:25.650
I made Mozarta's attack come to nothing.

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.390
Now, how will you make things more exciting?

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.160
I activate the effect of Aria the Melodious Diva!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:34.600
Once per turn, when I fail 
to deal battle damage,

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:37.130
I deal 800 points of damage to you.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:39.340
Resonate Wave!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:47.540
Well? Gives you the shivers, doesn't it?

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:52.280
Yuya, you're watching, right?

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.090
You aren't alone.

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:03.650
The fun isn't over yet!

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:08.360
I activate my Equip Spell 
Piping Pipes in my hand.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.700
I equip it to Mozarta.

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:15.820
This lets me negate damage 
from one effect spell

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:19.400
and increase Mozarta's attack 
points by the same amount!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.870
Wh-What?

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:22.440
Not bad.

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:25.980
She negated the 1500 damage Lightshower's 
effect would have dealt.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:28.950
I end my turn.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.550
My turn!

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:36.600
Spell card Super All In!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:40.290
Its effect returns Lightshower to my Extra Deck!

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.020
My enjoyment is only getting started, too.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:46.760
When Lightshower is returned to my 
Extra Deck, I can Special Summon

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:49.900
its Synchro-component monsters from 
my graveyard, all at Level 2.

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:50.870
What?

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:52.990
Come on! Pine with Crane,

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.090
Zebra Grass with Moon,

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:55.440
Paulownia with Phoenix,

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.580
Calligrapher with Willow!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.150
And then...

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:05.160
I draw one card, and if that 
card is a Flower Cardian,

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:08.060
it's Special Summoned at Level 2.

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:13.310
However, if it's anything but a Flower Cardian, 
I destroy all cards on my side of the field

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:15.460
and halve my life points.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:18.600
After returning Lightshower to his deck,

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.570
Tokumatsu risks half his life and 
all his monsters on this draw!

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.330
Let's go, my dear.

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:27.150
Watch me, Yuya...

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:30.960
I'll rile you up, too, with my 
own entertainment duel!

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:33.320
Enjoy!

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:39.020
Forgive me, my dear!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.420
I drew Flower Cardian Cherry 
Blossom with Curtain!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.660
He has five Level 2 Cardian Monsters...

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:53.450
Let's go, let's go, let's go...

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.900
Let's get them riled up!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:16:01.370
Level 2 Willow with Calligrapher tunes Level 2 
Flower Cardian Cherry Blossom with Curtain,

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:05.010
Pine with Crane, Zebra Grass with Moon, 
and Paulownia with Phoenix!

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:09.690
Let your godly, sacred light

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:13.620
become heaven, earth, water, 
ground, and metal... And shine!

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.090
Synchro Summon!

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:21.060
Flower Cardian Lightflare!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.360
5000 attack points?

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:29.530
If I attack Aria with Lightflare, 
your life will fall to 0.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:32.590
The effect of Piping Pipes means

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:37.180
that you can only attack Mozarta, 
the monster it's equipped to!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.180
What?

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.980
But you'll still take tremendous damage!

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:43.210
Forgive me! Battle!

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:46.050
Lightflare attacks Mozarta!

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:49.450
An Action Card!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.430
Action Card Overpass!

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.970
When two monsters do battle,

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:08.410
their attack points are swapped 
until the Battle Phase ends.

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:10.640
Has Yuzu turned this around?

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.840
I activate Lightflare's effect!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:17.240
I negate the effect of one of your 
spell cards and destroy it!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.590
No way.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:24.290
I attack Mozarta!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.940
I can't negate Fortissimo, as it 
was already activated,

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:37.200
but I can prevent you from 
activating any more spells.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:40.410
She can't even use Action Spells. Yuzu...

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:44.870
Yuzu's in deep, deep trouble!

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:47.660
I won't give up!

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:50.410
Yuya, watch me.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.760
My feelings are riding on this draw.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:56.050
My... turn!

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:57.790
I got it!

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.760
I summon Soprano the Melodious Songstress!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:03.930
When this card is used as a fusion component,

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:06.960
I can Fusion Summon it without 
a Polymerization card.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.690
I see...

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.440
She let that draw determine her fate.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.670
And I think she got the card she wanted.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:17.320
I fuse Soprano the Melodious Songstress 
and Aria the Melodious Diva.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:20.460
The angel's song. The supreme genius.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.140
Follow the baton and stack your power!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:25.120
Fusion Summon!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:29.270
Take the stage with the song of victory,

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:33.120
Bloom Diva the Melodious Choir!

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:41.900
Fusion?

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:43.690
Time for battle!

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:46.000
Bloom Diva attacks Lightflare!

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:47.870
This is madness!

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:52.440
Attacking a 5000-attack-point monster 
with one that has only 1000?

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:55.050
This card cannot be destroyed by battle.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:58.720
And battle damage dealt to its controller 
is turned back on my opponent,

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.390
and I destroy his monster!

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.250
Great one!

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:04.300
Forgive me...

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:07.610
But Lightflare can negate the effect 
of monsters in battle, too!

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:11.000
Tokumatsu takes the upper hand again!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.960
Will Yuzu's comeback move fail?

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:15.300
I'm not done yet.

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.640
An Action Card?

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.080
All right, I got it.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.950
Action Card Overpass!

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:37.200
It will be the same, no matter 
how many times you do it.

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.920
Lightflare's effect activates!

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:47.280
Yuzu keeps using Action Cards 
to try to turn things around.

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:50.130
But Tokumatsu is always one step ahead!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.190
It seems it's over for you.

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.800
No, it's only getting started.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:54.910
What?

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:59.610
I send Score the Melodious Diva from my hand 
to my graveyard, to activate its effect.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:03.640
I can banish two of the same spell 
card from my graveyard,

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.220
to activate that card's effect!

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:10.820
I activate the effect of Action Spell Overpass!

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:16.060
Lightflare can negate the effects of spell cards

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.920
and monsters on the field during battle.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:21.780
But it can't negate the effect 
of monsters in my hand.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.250
The effect of Overpass swaps the attack points

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:29.640
of monsters doing battle until 
the Battle Phase ends.

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:33.080
Bloom Diva!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.420
Reflect Shout!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.420
It's finished!

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:48.030
The powerful duel that had us in a 
cold sweat is finally over!

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:52.090
The winner is Yuzu!

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:54.500
I won...

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:56.200
All right!

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.920
Great job, Yuzu.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.250
You were incredible.

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:08.080
That was great fun, my dear.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:10.090
U-Um...

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:12.820
Do you know Yuya, by any chance?

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:15.910
Are you Yuya's lady friend?

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:18.860
Ow!

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.830
S-Sorry! Instinctive reaction.

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:23.520
Chojiro!

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.530
That was an amazing duel!

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:30.030
Duels are akin to life!

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.790
You only live once.

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.990
You win sometimes, and you lose sometimes.

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:38.480
Don't be ashamed of defeat. 
Don't be complacent in victory.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.910
In other words... Let's enjoy.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.110
Now, time to go.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:52.390
Great one, Chojiro!

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:53.820
Mr. Tokumatsu...

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:55.900
Yuzu! You did great!

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:58.600
My blood was boiling! You gave me shivers!

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:01.450
Yuya... I did it.

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:02.710
I gave it my all.

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:06.810
Yuzu, thank you.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:11.290
Your feelings reached me!

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:49.280
Coming up is the final match of the 
Friendship Cup's first day.

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:52.860
The last match will be Serena versus Tony!

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:55.710
Which one will seize victory?

00:23:56.090 --> 00:23:58.380
If Serena loses, she'll be sent underground.

00:23:58.380 --> 00:24:00.220
This is wrong!

00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:03.150
But what can I do from here?

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:06.870
Screaming won't change the Council's mind.

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:11.350
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Futile Screams.

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:13.620
The fun is only getting started!
